        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, mzighane mzuri wa Misri, kufunye wulodi aighu yake na aighu ya Misri yose ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kughambe, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba huwu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niko aho wandu wose wa Misri wichamanya kukaia Ini ne BWANA; kwa kukaia oho kodeeka sa mzata ghwa mrangi kwa wandu wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.36.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 36.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo werekuwadieghe na mkonu korechikieghe na kuwishaghua maonge ghawo, na ngelo werekusaghikieghe na oho, korechikieghe na kubonya viwonu vawo visughusike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba huwu, Ola nichareda wandu wikubwaghe kwa lufu, nawo wichabwagha mdamu na nyamandu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na isanga ja Misri jichasighwa iduu; nawo wichamanya kukaia Ini ne BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa kukaia kwaghambie wei, ‘Naili ni yapo, ni ini nereibonyereghe,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa wundu ugho, ola ne m'maiza wako na wa iyo meda yako. Nichajibonya isanga ja Misri jiwuye iduu putu kufuma muzi ghwa Migdoli hata muzi ghwa Aswani, hata mpakenyi na Ethiopia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mdamu ungi ndechaawadia aho, hata nyamandu ndeichaawadia aho; jichakaia iduu kwa miaka mirongo ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nichajibonya isanga ja Misri jiwoneke iduu kuchumba masanga ghose ghiko maduu; na mizi yake ichasighwa miduu kwa miaka mirongo ina aghadi ya mizi yose isighilo miduu. Nichasasara Wamisri aghadi ya iro mbari ra wandu, na kuwisaghisa masangenyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana MLUNGU waghamba huwu, “Kutua kwa miaka mirongo ina nichawikwanya Wamisri kufuma kwa wandu andu weresaghisiroghe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nani nichawunja wandu wa Misri isangenyi Pathrosi andu werefumieghe; na aho wichazoya wuzuri ghwa ndonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuzuri ghwawo ghuchakaia ghwa ndonyi kuchumba mawuzuri ghose, hata ndewichaakujosa sena aghadi ya iro mbari ra wandu; nichawisera nandighi hata wisedime sena kuwibonyera mbari zima nguma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misri ndeichaakaia isuwirio ja Waisraeli sena, ela ichakaia lukumbuso lokumbusa Waisraeli ikosa jawo jekusaghika na Wamisri. Aho niko wichamanya kukaia ini ne Bwana MLUNGU.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Nebukadnezari kusima Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja imbiri, ja mori ghwa imbiri, mwaka ghwa mirongo iwi na mfungade ghwa kudwalwa wunyika kodu, BWANA oreghorieghe nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni wabonyere ijeshi jake jibonye kazi ikurie elwa na Tiro. Misigo ilemere yashekerie vongo va masikari vikakangaluka, na maonge ghikazurua; ela sena uo, na ijeshi jake, ndewipatire fwaida ingi Tiro edima kukatanishwa na iyo kazi wiibonyere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba huwu: Olenyi nichamneka Nebukadnezari isanga ja Misri, nao uchawada mali raro na kuridwa wunyika, ripate kuwuya malipo gha iyo kazi ikurie ibonyero ni ijeshi jake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namnekie isanga ja Misri jikaie malipo ghake gha wudumiki orenidumikieghe, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ngelo maza iro richaabonyeka, nichawibonya wandu wa Israeli wikaie na ndighi, nani nichakubonya oho Ezekieli kughore nawo aghadi kwawo. Aho niko wichaamanya kukaia Ini ne BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
